word-illustrations/senior/inaugurate-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-incarcerate-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"incarcerate","sort_order":1,"sense":"監禁","alt_zh":"成年已定罪者在成年守衛陪同下平靜走入矯正機構大門，無武器、束縛或虐待。","example":"The court decided to incarcerate the convicted thief.","example_zh":"法院決定監禁已定罪的竊賊。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/incarcerate-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-inception-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"inception","sort_order":1,"sense":"開始","alt_zh":"高中生與老師在首次規劃會議中，把花園草圖與模型零件放上桌討論。","example":"Students helped design the garden from the project's inception.","example_zh":"學生從計畫一開始就參與花園設計。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/inception-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-incidental-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"incidental","sort_order":1,"sense":"偶發的；附帶的","alt_zh":"高中生在花園演奏樂器，附近枝頭的小鳥同時鳴叫。","example":"The birdsong was an incidental part of our rehearsal in the garden.","example_zh":"鳥鳴是我們在花園排練時的附帶聲音。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/incidental-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-inclusive-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"inclusive","sort_order":1,"sense":"包容的","alt_zh":"不同能力的高中生平等參加美術社，輪椅同學與其他人一起在合適高度的桌前創作。","example":"The inclusive art club welcomed students with many different abilities.","example_zh":"這個包容的美術社歡迎能力各異的學生。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/inclusive-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-incompatible-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"incompatible","sort_order":1,"sense":"不相容的","alt_zh":"老師在未通電的示範桌上，比較形狀不吻合的插頭與插座模型。","example":"The new plug was incompatible with the old classroom socket.","example_zh":"新插頭與教室的舊插座不相容。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/incompatible-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-increment-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"increment","sort_order":1,"sense":"增量","alt_zh":"高中生在模型橋上原有砝碼旁，再輕放一個小砝碼。","example":"We added a small increment of weight before testing the bridge again.","example_zh":"我們增加一小份重量，再次測試橋梁。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/increment-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-incur-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"incur","sort_order":1,"sense":"招致","alt_zh":"高中生把壞掉的推車輪交給成年修理師，桌上有維修文件與硬幣。","example":"A broken wheel caused the club to incur extra repair costs.","example_zh":"輪子壞掉，讓社團多出維修費用。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/incur-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-indignation-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"indignation","sort_order":1,"sense":"憤慨","alt_zh":"高中生看見樹幹被不當破壞，神情難過而憤慨，向管理員說明。","example":"The students expressed indignation when the old tree was damaged.","example_zh":"老樹遭破壞時，學生表達了憤慨。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/indignation-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-indoctrinate-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"indoctrinate","sort_order":1,"sense":"灌輸","alt_zh":"虛構歷史故事中，成年統治者對成年官員單向訓話，有人想提問卻未被允許，無標語。","example":"The novel showed a ruler trying to indoctrinate citizens into blind obedience.","example_zh":"小說呈現統治者試圖灌輸人民盲目服從的觀念。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/indoctrinate-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","styl