受損。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/inflict-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-infringe-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"infringe","sort_order":1,"sense":"侵犯","alt_zh":"成年女子停下伸向他人密封信件的手，將信完整放回桌上，沒有可讀地址。","example":"Please do not infringe on another person's privacy by opening their letters.","example_zh":"請不要拆開別人的信，侵犯對方隱私。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/infringe-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-ingenious-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"ingenious","sort_order":1,"sense":"巧妙的","alt_zh":"高中生展示用回收瓶與細管組成的低壓滴灌小裝置，水滴流向盆栽。","example":"The ingenious watering device used a bottle and a simple tube.","example_zh":"巧妙的澆水裝置使用一個瓶子與簡單管子。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/ingenious-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-ingredient-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"ingredient","sort_order":1,"sense":"成分","alt_zh":"高中生在老師旁把麵粉加入烘焙碗，桌上有酵母與其他麵包材料。","example":"Flour was the main ingredient in the bread we baked.","example_zh":"麵粉是我們烤麵包的主要成分。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/ingredient-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-inheritance-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"inheritance","sort_order":1,"sense":"繼承","alt_zh":"成年孫女小心打開祖母留下的老提琴盒，旁邊放著祖母相框。","example":"The old violin was part of her inheritance from her grandmother.","example_zh":"那把老提琴是祖母留給她的一部分遺產。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/inheritance-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-initiation-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"initiation","sort_order":1,"sense":"啟動","alt_zh":"高中志工與成年領隊首次在池塘旁集合，分發工具、準備開始復育。","example":"The initiation of the pond project brought all the volunteers together.","example_zh":"池塘計畫的啟動，讓所有志工聚集起來。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/initiation-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-injunction-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"injunction","sort_order":1,"sense":"禁令","alt_zh":"成年官員向工地主管出示無字正式文件，施工車停在濕地外的安全封鎖區。","example":"The court issued an injunction to stop work near the protected wetland.","example_zh":"法院發出禁令，停止保護濕地附近的工程。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/injunction-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-innocence-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"innocence","sort_order":1,"sense":"無辜","alt_zh":"老師向高中生展示能釐清誤會的照片，原本被誤會的學生鬆一口氣。","example":"The clear photograph proved the student's innocence.","example_zh":"清楚的照片證明那位學生是無辜的。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/innocence-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-innovative-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"innovative","sort_order":1,"sense":"創新的","alt_zh":"高中生與老師查看屋頂花園中巧妙的集雨槽、儲水桶與植物配置模型。","example":"The innovative design collected rainwater in the school's roof garden.","example_zh":"創新的設計能在學校屋頂花園收集雨水。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/innovative-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-inoculate-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"inoculate","sort_order":1,"sense":"接種","alt_zh":"成年護理師在整潔診間準備密封醫療用品，成年志工平靜等候，無血跡或針刺畫面。","example":"The clinic planned to inoculate the volunteers during the health program.","example_zh":"診所計畫在健康活動中為志工接種疫苗。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/inoculate-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-insane-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"insane","sort_order":1,"sense":"瘋狂的","alt_zh":"成年活動隊員在安全室內看外面風雨，收好競速裝備，決定留在避雨處。","example":"We abandoned the insane plan to race through the storm.","example_zh":"我們放棄了在暴風雨中競速的瘋狂計畫。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/insane-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-inscription-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"inscription","sort_order":1,"sense":"銘文","alt_zh":"高中生在博物館仔細看古石表面磨損的刻痕，符號不可辨識、不形成可讀文字。","example":"The old stone carried an inscription carved by hand.","example_zh":"老石頭上有手工雕刻的銘文。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/inscription-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-insignificant-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"insignificant","sort_order":1,"sense":"微不足道的","alt_zh":"高中生欣賞精美陶碗，表面只有極小色點，仍露出滿意笑容。","example":"A tiny stain was an insignificant flaw in the beautiful handmade bowl.","example_zh":"精美手工碗上的小色點，是個微不足道的瑕疵。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/insignificant-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-insistence-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"insistence","sort_order":1,"sense":"堅持","alt_zh":"高中女生認真示意同伴先檢查安全帽，老師在旁支持，腳踏車仍停放著。","example":"At her insistence, we checked every helmet before the ride.","example_zh":"在她堅持下，我們騎車前檢查了每頂安全帽。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/insistence-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-insolvent-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"insolvent","sort_order":1,"sense":"破產的；無力償債的","alt_zh":"成年公司負責人與會計看著空現金盒和未支付帳單，神情嚴肅，文字不可讀。","example":"The insolvent company could no longer repay its debts.","example_zh":"那家無力償債的公司，已無法還清債務。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/insolvent-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-inspection-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"inspection","sort_order":1,"sense":"檢查","alt_zh":"老師與高中生仔細檢查腳踏車，指出車架上一顆鬆動螺栓。","example":"The safety inspection found a loose bolt on the bicycle.","example_zh":"安全檢查發現腳踏車上有顆鬆動螺栓。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/inspection-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-instability-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"instability","sort_order":1,"sense":"不穩定","alt_zh":"高中生扶住搖晃的模型高塔，老師指出過窄底座，旁邊準備較寬底板。","example":"The narrow base caused instability in the tall model tower.","example_zh":"狹窄底座讓高模型塔不穩定。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/instability-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-installment-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"installment","sort_order":1,"sense":"分期","alt_zh":"成年音樂家在樂器店與店主確認付款文件，桌上有象徵不同月份的小硬幣堆。","example":"The musician paid for the violin in monthly installments.","example_zh":"音樂家用每月分期付款的方式買提琴。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/installment-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-institution-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"institution","sort_order":1,"sense":"機構","alt_zh":"高中生參觀地方博物館，工作人員整理古照片、工具與文物展示。","example":"The museum is an institution dedicated to preserving local history.","example_zh":"這座博物館是致力保存地方歷史的機構。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/institution-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-instruction-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"instruction","sort_order":1,"sense":"指示","alt_zh":"老師指著只有摺紙圖形與箭頭的說明，高中生照著摺出紙鶴。","example":"The clear instruction helped us fold the paper crane correctly.","example_zh":"清楚的指示幫助我們正確摺出紙鶴。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/instruction-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-insufficient-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"insufficient","sort_order":1,"sense":"不足的","alt_zh":"老師與高中生查看安全低壓太陽能教學模型，小面板連著只有微光的大燈模型。","example":"The small solar panel provided insufficient power for the large lamp.","example_zh":"小太陽能板提供的電力，不足以讓大燈亮起。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/insufficient-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-insulate-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"insulate","sort_order":1,"sense":"隔離；隔熱；保溫","alt_zh":"高中生把厚羊毛層放入模型小屋牆體夾層，老師在旁解說保溫。","example":"We used thick wool to insulate the model house against the cold.","example_zh":"我們用厚羊毛替模型屋保溫，阻隔寒冷。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/insulate-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-insurgent-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"insurgent","sort_order":1,"sense":"叛軍","alt_zh":"歷史展覽模型中，成年前叛軍成員穿無標誌服裝，與成年代表平靜圍桌談判，無武器。","example":"The history exhibit described an insurgent who later joined peace talks.","example_zh":"歷史展覽介紹一位後來參加和平談判的叛軍成員。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/insurgent-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-integral-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"integral","sort_order":1,"sense":"不可或缺的","alt_zh":"高中生與老師查看魚缸裡帶動水流的水泵，魚和水草健康生長。","example":"The water pump was an integral part of our classroom aquarium.","example_zh":"水泵是教室魚缸不可或缺的一部分。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/integral-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-intellectual-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"intellectual","sort_order":1,"sense":"智力的","alt_zh":"高中生專注合作解開複雜立體木製拼圖，桌面整潔。","example":"The difficult puzzle offered an intellectual challenge for the whole team.","example_zh":"這道難題為整個小組帶來智力挑戰。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/intellectual-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-intelligence-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"intelligence","sort_order":1,"sense":"情報","alt_zh":"高中生在歷史博物館觀察舊航海圖、望遠鏡與密封文件，無可讀地名或軍事細節。","example":"The naval museum displayed old maps used to gather intelligence.","example_zh":"海軍博物館展示過去用於蒐集情報的地圖。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/intelligence-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-interaction-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"interaction","sort_order":1,"sense":"互動","alt_zh":"高中志工互相遞工具、微笑交談，並邀請新成員一起工作。","example":"The friendly interaction between the volunteers encouraged the new member.","example_zh":"志工之間友善的互動，鼓勵了新成員。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/interaction-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-intercept-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"intercept","sort_order":1,"sense":"攔截","alt_zh":"高中女生在正常籃球比賽中快速伸手攔截空中傳球，穿端莊運動服。","example":"Nora ran forward to intercept the pass.","example_zh":"諾拉跑向前，攔下對方的傳球。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/intercept-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-interdependence-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"interdependence","sort_order":1,"sense":"相互依存","alt_zh":"高中生在花園觀察蜜蜂採蜜與授粉，花朵繁盛，老師在旁解說。","example":"The class studied the interdependence of bees and flowering plants.","example_zh":"班上研究蜜蜂與開花植物之間的相互依存。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/interdependence-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-interior-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"interior","sort_order":1,"sense":"內部","alt_zh":"溫暖木屋內有手工木桌、椅子與書架，家人在柔和燈光下休息。","example":"The cabin's interior was warm and filled with handmade furniture.","example_zh":"木屋內部溫暖，擺滿手工家具。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/interior-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-intermediary-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"intermediary","sort_order":1,"sense":"中間人","alt_zh":"老師坐在兩組高中社團代表之間，協助雙方傳達意見與文件。","example":"The teacher acted as an intermediary between the two clubs.","example_zh":"老師擔任兩個社團之間的中間人。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/intermediary-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-interpretation-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"interpretation","sort_order":1,"sense":"解讀","alt_zh":"高中女生向讀書小組分享詩的想法，桌上有無可讀文字的詩集與雨後晴天畫作。","example":"Her interpretation of the poem focused on hope after hardship.","example_zh":"她對詩的解讀，著重於困境過後的希望。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/interpretation-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-interrogate-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"interrogate","sort_order":1,"sense":"審問","alt_zh":"成年偵探與成年嫌疑人、律師在明亮辦公室平靜談話，桌上有畫作照片，無威脅。","example":"The detective began to interrogate the suspect about the missing painting.","example_zh":"偵探開始詢問嫌疑人關於失蹤畫作的事。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/interrogate-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-intersection-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"intersection","sort_order":1,"sense":"十字路口；交叉口","alt_zh":"導護人員示意車輛停下，高中生沿清楚斑馬線安全穿過十字路口。","example":"The crossing guard helped students cross the busy intersection.","example_zh":"導護人員幫助學生穿越繁忙交叉路口。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/intersection-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-intervention-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"intervention","sort_order":1,"sense":"干預","alt_zh":"輔導老師平靜加入兩名高中生的談話，協助彼此輪流表達並握手和解。","example":"The counselor's intervention helped the classmates resolve their disagreement.","example_zh":"輔導老師的介入，幫助同學化解歧見。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/intervention-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-intimidate-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"intimidate","sort_order":1,"sense":"恐嚇","alt_zh":"成年球員帶著威嚇表情靠近對手，成年裁判伸手阻止，無推擠或受傷。","example":"The player tried to intimidate his opponent, but the referee intervened.","example_zh":"球員試圖恐嚇對手，但裁判立即介入。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/intimidate-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-intolerance-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"intolerance","sort_order":1,"sense":"不容忍；偏狹","alt_zh":"高中生在老師引導下討論分歧，一名學生抱臂拒聽，其他人友善邀請不同意見者發言。","example":"The class discussed how intolerance can exclude people with different opinions.","example_zh":"班上討論偏狹如何排斥持不同意見的人。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/intolerance-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"gener