base.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/irrigation-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-isolationism-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"isolationism","sort_order":1,"sense":"孤立主義","alt_zh":"老師用虛構立體地圖客觀解說，一座城邦獨立在同盟網絡外，無旗幟或標語。","example":"The history lesson examined isolationism and reluctance to join foreign alliances.","example_zh":"歷史課探討孤立主義，以及不願加入國際同盟的態度。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/isolationism-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-itinerary-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"itinerary","sort_order":1,"sense":"行程表；旅行計畫","alt_zh":"高中生與老師用城鎮模型和無字行程卡，安排博物館、港口與花園的參訪。","example":"Our itinerary included the museum, the old harbor, and a quiet garden.","example_zh":"我們的行程包括博物館、老港口與安靜花園。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/itinerary-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-jargon-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"jargon","sort_order":1,"sense":"術語","alt_zh":"成年技師在機器人工坊向高中生耐心解說零件與工具，沒有可讀文字。","example":"The technician explained the jargon in simple words for the students.","example_zh":"技師用簡單的話，向學生解釋專業術語。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/jargon-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-journalism-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"journalism","sort_order":1,"sense":"新聞業","alt_zh":"高中校刊成員拿著錄音器與筆記本，禮貌訪問校園園丁。","example":"The students explored journalism by interviewing people for the school paper.","example_zh":"學生透過為校刊採訪人物，探索新聞工作。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/journalism-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-jubilee-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"jubilee","sort_order":1,"sense":"慶典","alt_zh":"學校禮堂裡，不同世代校友與高中生歡聚，樂團演奏，無數字或標語。","example":"The school celebrated its jubilee with a concert and a reunion.","example_zh":"學校以音樂會與校友聚會慶祝週年慶典。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/jubilee-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-judiciary-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"judiciary","sort_order":1,"sense":"司法機構","alt_zh":"高中生在司法博物館觀察法庭模型，導覽員指向成年法官席與證人席。","example":"The museum explained the judiciary's role in applying the law.","example_zh":"博物館說明司法機構適用法律的角色。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/judiciary-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-justification-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"justification","sort_order":1,"sense":"正當理由","alt_zh":"成年工程師指出木橋支梁的嚴重裂縫，管理員在安全入口設好路障。","example":"The cracked beam provided justification for closing the footbridge.","example_zh":"橫梁裂縫提供了關閉人行橋的正當理由。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/justification-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-juvenile-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"juvenile","sort_order":1,"sense":"少年的；幼年的","alt_zh":"溫暖樹巢裡的幼鳥安靜張望，成年親鳥帶著食物飛回。","example":"The juvenile bird waited in the nest while its parents gathered food.","example_zh":"幼鳥待在巢裡，等待親鳥覓食。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/juvenile-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-keynote-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"keynote","sort_order":1,"sense":"主題；主題演說","alt_zh":"成年科學家在開幕講台上熱情演說，高中觀眾專注聆聽，旁邊有科學模型。","example":"The keynote set a hopeful tone for the science festival.","example_zh":"主題演說為科學節帶來充滿希望的氣氛。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/obje