ple_zh":"螃蟹側向走過沙地。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/lateral-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-latitude-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"latitude","sort_order":1,"sense":"緯度","alt_zh":"高中生觀察完全無字的地球儀，清楚可見赤道與平行的緯線圓圈。","example":"The globe showed latitude as circles parallel to the equator.","example_zh":"地球儀用平行赤道的圓圈表示緯度。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/latitude-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-launder-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"launder","sort_order":1,"sense":"洗錢","alt_zh":"成年法官與會計專家在法庭查看假造公司帳目示意文件，無可讀數據或犯罪方法。","example":"The court examined evidence that the company had tried to launder money.","example_zh":"法院檢視公司企圖洗錢的證據。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/launder-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-lawsuit-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"lawsuit","sort_order":1,"sense":"訴訟","alt_zh":"成年鄰居與律師在法院調解室平靜握手，桌上有無字協議文件。","example":"The neighbors settled the lawsuit after reaching a fair agreement.","example_zh":"鄰居達成公平協議後，解決了訴訟。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/lawsuit-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-legislature-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"legislature","sort_order":1,"sense":"立法機關","alt_zh":"虛構議會中的成年議員查看森林模型，正式輪流發言，無黨徽或標語。","example":"The legislature debated a proposal to protect the old forest.","example_zh":"立法機關辯論保護古老森林的提案。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/legislature-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-legitimacy-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"legitimacy","sort_order":1,"sense":"合法性","alt_zh":"成年行政人員仔細檢查文件上的正式封印與簽章形狀，文字不可辨識。","example":"The official seal helped confirm the document's legitimacy.","example_zh":"官方印章有助於確認文件的合法性。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/legitimacy-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-lethargy-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"lethargy","sort_order":1,"sense":"昏睡；倦怠","alt_zh":"成年旅人提著行李慢慢走到旅館椅子旁，疲倦但安全地坐下休息。","example":"After the long journey, a feeling of lethargy made him move slowly.","example_zh":"漫長旅程後，他倦怠得動作緩慢。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/lethargy-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-levy-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"levy","sort_order":1,"sense":"徵收","alt_zh":"虛構城鎮的成年委員在橋梁模型與小硬幣堆前表決，無金額或口號。","example":"The imaginary town voted to levy a small tax for its new bridge.","example_zh":"虛構城鎮投票決定徵收小額稅款，興建新橋。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/levy-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-lexicon-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"lexicon","sort_order":1,"sense":"詞彙","alt_zh":"高中生在教室把植物、工具與天氣圖卡整理成小冊，字跡不可辨識。","example":"The class created a lexicon of words related to the school garden.","example_zh":"班上整理一份與校園花園相關的詞彙集。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/lexicon-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-liability-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"liability","sort_order":1,"sense":"責任","alt_zh":"高中生在老師旁仔細閱讀借用說明後，把相機妥善放入保護袋，無可讀文字。","example":"Anyone borrowing the camera accepted liability for careless damage.","example_zh":"借相機的人同意為疏忽造成的損壞負責。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/